        "TileImage": "$($repository 19b41ff9-6c9e-47ef-b6dd-a3d64d1a3307).Image",
        "Description": "Good evening Agent MungaSeven, Lucy Phillips has been dying to get rid of her &apos;friend&apos; Cornelia for months now. With little success, she has contracted our services as she is unable to fake friendliness any longer.\r\rDue to the extreme lengths she has had to go to, she would also like to deal with a few other enemies she has made during her time in Dubai - to get more &apos;bang for her buck&apos;, as it were.\r\rGood luck, and happy hunting.",
